{"t":"Isle of Merriment","s":"isle-of-merriment-d50f3","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Isle_of_Merriment_63c27a.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Isle of Merriment</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Isle of Merriment\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"226\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Isle_of_Merriment_63c27a.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Community Managers</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> - <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31949,31805,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">[124.205-124.61-7] (31949, 31805, 7)</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.30.9287<br/>December 02, 2019<br/>Winter Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Isle of Merriment</b> is a small arena island west of the main continent. It was first opened for the public on November 18, 2019, during the Test Server of the Winter Update 2019. The Isle was created as a replacement for the traditional Monster Rampages on the last day of Test Servers which usually are very popular. To access the island you must enter a <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a> that appears on <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> crossroads. This teleport, however, can be activated and deactivated by CipSoft members and is only enabled for the small duration of the raids during the last day of Test Server. \n</p><p>At the center of the island there is an arena where CipSoft members, usually a Community Manager, can summon all types of creatures and bosses for deadly battle against players. Several levers in closed rooms near the arena allows the CipSoft members to easily remove all players from the arena or the island, close the arena gates or clear the arena from creatures, allowing them to quickly restart the battle with different themes (such a a raid of several <a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Versperoth\">Versperoth</a> labyrinth).\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\">  <img alt=\"Isle_of_Merriment\" class=\"\" data-video-key=\"Isle_of_Merriment\" data-video-name=\"Isle of Merriment\" height=\"101\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Isle_of_Merriment_fb6130.png\" width=\"180\"/> <span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> <svg aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg> </span>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"title\">Isle of Merriment</p> <p class=\"caption\">Overview of the island during the 2019 Winter Test Server</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Around the arena main floor there is a grandstand for those who wish to only watch the fight, but not participate in it. On the floor above it, it's also possible to walk over the field and watch everything. Around the arena wall, several rare and some unobtainable items are displayed, such as <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dragon Scale Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Scale_Legs_383886.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Dragon Scale Legs, a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Doll (Blond)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Doll_Blond_1d67e5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Doll (Blond) and <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Boots of Waterwalking\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Waterwalking_087864.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Boots of Waterwalking. \n</p><p>On the ground floor around the building there are spawns of some creatures with their old sprites, as well as one <a href=\"#/wiki/Yeti\">Yeti</a>. Near the entrance teleport there's also a Swimming area.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug%20%28Nostalgia%29\"><img alt=\"Bug (Nostalgia)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bug_Nostalgia_92151d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Bug (Nostalgia)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">29</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">23? <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span><