 Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></li>\n<li>0-2?× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20%28Nostalgia%29\"><img alt=\"Bonelord (Nostalgia)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonelord_Nostalgia_6bb19a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Bonelord (Nostalgia)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">157</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">260</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">235?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-82?× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morning%20Star\">Morning Star</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook\">Spellbook</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider%20%28Nostalgia%29\"><img alt=\"Giant Spider (Nostalgia)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Giant_Spider_Nostalgia_507c10.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Giant Spider (Nostalgia)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">840</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,300</td><td styl